      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the 7‑layer bubble wrap applied to protect my bike during transit from Shahganj to other cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our technicians first wrap the bike frame with an 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble sheet, then add high‑density foam edge protectors around handlebars, mirrors, and footrests. Next, corrugated fiberboard sheets shield larger surfaces, followed by a weather‑proof stretch film. Finally, custom wooden crates enclose the bike, and a top layer of shock‑absorbent bubble ensures zero‑scratch delivery. This systematic layering, combined with IRDAI‑approved insurance, guarantees your bike arrives pristine.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for booking a bike parcel with Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers in Shahganj Jaunpur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID (Aadhaar or PAN), the bike’s registration certificate, a signed consignment note, and GST‑compliant invoice for corporate clients. For government or PSU reimbursements, include the IBA‑approved mover code reference. Our team verifies each document at pickup to ensure smooth customs and insurance processing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike parcel in real time while it travels on the national highway corridors?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every bike parcel is equipped with a GPS tracker linked to our 24/7 monitoring center. You receive instant SMS and email updates at key milestones—departure, en‑route checkpoints, and arrival. The live map is also accessible through our customer portal, allowing you to view the exact location of your bike at any time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is the transit insurance mandatory and what does it cover for my two‑wheeler?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit insurance is optional but highly recommended. Our IRDAI‑approved policy covers accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities up to the declared value of the bike. In case of any loss, the claim is processed within 7‑10 business days, and you receive full reimbursement without hidden deductions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike transportation typically take from Shahganj to major transport hubs like Delhi or Kolkata?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time ranges from 12 to 18 hours for Delhi (≈850 km) and 24 to 30 hours for Kolkata, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Our dedicated multi‑axle express freight highways and hydraulic ramp loading minimize delays, ensuring your bike reaches the destination within the promised window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any size or weight restrictions for scooters and high‑performance bikes?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We accommodate all standard two‑wheelers up to 250 kg gross vehicle weight. Scooters and scooties fit comfortably in our 18‑ft and 22‑ft containers, while high‑performance motorcycles may require the 32‑ft MX trailer for additional clearance. Our team assesses each bike at pickup to select the optimal container size.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system prevent damage compared to traditional loading methods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp provides a smooth, level incline that eliminates the need for manual lifting or forklift use. Bikes are driven onto the ramp, secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and wheel chocks prevent movement. This controlled process reduces impact forces, protecting delicate components and ensuring a scratch‑free journey.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
